{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/433054-vigilant-times","id":433054,"title":"Vigilant Times","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-08T13:39:05-07:00","id":433054,"title":"Vigilant Times","content":"While no Hunter Dark Era has won during the Kickstarter, I've thought why let those ideas to go to waste? So I've that maybe we can work together as Hunter fans and make something like Ancient Mysteries for Hunter. I'm personally planning to work on what I like, but I do hope that other people would join this effort. Hunter deserves this love.<br /> <br /> So- on which Eras we are talking about-<br /> <br /> <b>Book of Judges</b>- biblical times and ancient wars under the guidance of holy men and pagan priests<br /> <b>Spanish Inquisition</b>- when heretics had to hide from the fury of the church<br /> <b>WWII</b>- the rise and fall of Great Powers in the world.<br /> <b>1830's India</b>- the influence of the Thuggee cult upon hunters and the Vigil.<br /> <br /> Eras which weren't belonged to any line<br /> <b>The American Revolutionary War</b><br /> <b>Wars of Scottish Independence</b><br /> <br /> Eras which weren't official part of Hunter, but we can steal them (and use the gameline to which it was made as the &quot;main antagonist&quot;)<br /> <b>all the Canon Eras</b><br /> <b>French Revolution </b><br /> <b>Golden Age of Piracy </b><br /> <b>Serpent and the Rainbow</b><br /> <b>Wild West </b><br /> <b>Any other Eras you think could be cool</b><br /> <br /> Fan made Eras<br /> <b>Haudenosaunee Hunter</b> (suggested by Glamourweaver)<br /> <b>Vigil For Rome</b> (again, Glamourweaver has worked on that one)<br /> <b>Greenland Lost</b> (suggested by Cire)<br /> again, any other Era you think would be cool.<br /> <br /> so- any volunteers?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T14:10:15-07:00","id":433108,"title":"","content":"Ancient Mysteries is a great idea for Hunter; much more practical than my ridiculously comprehensive WWII outline.<br /> <br /> For Eras, here's my suggestions:<br /> <br /> <b>Second Temple Period Judea -</b> I'm recommending this over Book of Judges because Ancient Mysteries is about supporting modern day games with historical stuff. The Second Temple Period is where you can find lore and Endowments that might show up today *cough* Hakollel *cough*. That said, I don't object to having one big ancient Judea that stretches from the Book of Judges all the way to the Second Temple Period.<br /> <br /> <b>The Great Silk Road</b> - I'm cheating a little, this is actually concurrent with the Second Temple Period, however it's a great time for the Ascending Ones (the origins of their narcotics traid) and the Ageis Kai Doru, as they spread along the roads stealing artefacts and acquiring influence.<br /> <br /> <b>1960s</b><b>- </b>America's Student revolution. The Maden Blood's sisterhood's birth. TF:V is The Man. Vampires are The Man. Conspiracy theories galore. (It's a shame that the Illuminated Brotherhood weren't founded yet. Its a good thing the Keepers weren't founded yet, because I can't write them without trying to fix them.)<br /> <br /> <b>WWII</b><b>- </b>an absolute must. The birth of TF:V, MI18, KSI21, the fall of the Order of St. Anthony. It's too important to miss.<br /> <br /> <br /> You'll notice I'm focusing here on existing organisations over new ones. I think that might be a safe starting point, we can always branch out later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":134,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","user":"The Kings Raven","date":". 03-08-2015, 05:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T18:49:04-07:00","id":433404,"title":"","content":"I'm hoping Hunter claims Sengoku Japan, because I really want to see an entirely non-Western host of new organizations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T18:59:56-07:00","id":433416,"title":"","content":"Is there any other option for Hunter in the &quot;unclaimed Dark Eras spot&quot; than the Samurai? I'd rather see something else for Hunter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T19:50:22-07:00","id":433488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dude of Legend</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/433054-vigilant-times?p=433416#post433416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__doub